      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One writer to the index",
      "items": [
        "Only a passed and signed-off candidate reaches pgvector",
        "Publishing moves the serving alias, students keep vN until then"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Versioned at every step",
      "items": [
        "A new sha256 is a new doc_version, corrections supersede",
        "chunk_id is content-addressed, unchanged pages are reused"
      ]
